{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360220","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1036022001:1":{"text":"저는 아버지와 달리 낚시를 싫어해요.","source_cn":"父亲喜欢钓鱼，但我和父亲不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB7756CAA08612F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036022002:1":{"text":"예전에는 아버지가 낚시해 오시면 전 그냥 먹기만 했죠.","source_cn":"以前父亲钓了鱼，我都是只负责吃鱼的那个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A55F3CEB319591","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1036022003:1":{"text":"오늘은 제가 배고픈 마을 사람에게 물고기를 몇 마리 낚아 주고 싶은데,","source_cn":"今天我也想钓几只鱼给大家填肚子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5D7087184F23338","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1036022004:1":{"text":"연못에 물고기가 하나도 없네요.","source_cn":"结果里面除了水，什么都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E858B14FCC41D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民诺尔贝奇":{"text":"노르베치","source":"村民诺尔贝奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}